  "abstract_summary": "We introduce CrownFusion, a latent diffusion model to generate 3D dental crown designs from geometry images, a 2D-grid encoding of surface coordinates. Departing from traditional approaches that use point clouds, our \"CrownImage\" representation not only unlocks the full power of image-based generative architectures,...",
